                    "value": "A new Island: smaller, shaped like Blanc's Island on the Mac, and only as wide as what's in it: Back, the site's icon and the site, and New Tab."
                  }
                ],
                "url": null
              },
              {
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Tap the site and the Island grows into a panel just above the keyboard. It starts with the page's address: tap it to edit, hold it to copy the link."
                  }
                ],
                "url": null
              },
              {
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "In a private tab the Island turns dark, and Close Private Tab is first in the page menu."
                  }
                ],
                "url": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
